{"id":"vod_sn_38294","vodId":"38294","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"斯特拉的魔法","name_cn":"斯特拉的魔法","date":"2016-01-01","year":"2016","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/15407a08cc45239ff51a9c9b99d4a3e4.jpg"},"summary":"本田朱辉（长绳麻理亚 配音）是刚刚升上高中一年级的可爱女生，在开学典礼那一天，朱辉偶然遇见了专门制作同人游戏的社团“SNS部”的成员们，一直以来都没有找到自己真正想做的事情的朱辉终于确定了理想，那就是制作同人游戏。　　然而，对于游戏制作，无论是哪一方面朱辉都可谓是一窍不通。每天都被阴云笼罩情绪低落的部长村上椎奈（村川梨衣 配音）、咋咋呼呼大大咧咧个性极为开朗的关菖蒲（小泽亚李 配音）、在音乐方面有着超越了常人的天赋的藤川歌夜（悠木碧 配音）、有些天然呆常常闹出笑话的布田裕美音（前川凉子 配音），在这些朋友们的帮助下，朱辉能够顺利走上游戏制作师的道路吗？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:00:05","playable":true,"episodeCount":14,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/z3XcffXqtP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qFdApeqqCA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/CiuP3gF4Rb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/vg2Atg1uhP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/EeyskXahJC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/HPcNBGmxfd1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/dzXUcUDbuH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/U77mrUHPJV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/XKhGE0u1Ff1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/id6QKtbMmT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/QrHVMsvFNu1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8UvU2hQeVc1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/nJQRWdgYBQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/vU8LEYxxJs1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"20